## 4. Technical Architecture Strategy

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Frontend (Parent) | React Native (Expo) for native iOS and Android delivery |
| Frontend (School/Admin) | Next.js (React) for responsive desktop and lightweight mobile-web access |
| Backend/Database | Node.js serverless functions running on Supabase (PostgreSQL) for rapid, scalable CRUD operations and authentication |
| Integrations | Google Maps Distance Matrix API for dynamic routing/commute tracking |

---

## 5. Out of Scope for MVP (Phase 2 Fast-Follows)

- **AI Sentiment Analysis:** Scraping Reddit and unstructured web data to calculate qualitative "Sentiment Scores" (Highly Positive vs. Negative) will be deferred until primary data pipelines are stable. Initial MVP will rely solely on aggregated Google Review scores.
- **Payment Gateway Integration:** In-app fee payments for the admission forms.
